---
layout: base.njk
title: "Practice Areas | Corporate Law, Contracts, IP & Dispute Resolution in India"
description: "VidhiCorp Legal Chambers' 15 practice areas spanning corporate & commercial law, M&A, contracts, IP, dispute resolution, compliance, real estate and private client matters for businesses across India."
permalink: /practice-areas/
metaTitle: "Practice Areas & Sectors | VidhiCorp Legal Chambers"
metaDescription: "Fifteen practice areas across corporate law, contracts, M&A, IP, employment and dispute resolution, and the sectors we advise across India."
---
<section class="page-hero has-photo grain">
  <div class="ph-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=1400&q=55&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" width="1400" height="933" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Practice Areas</p>
    <h1>Practice areas</h1>
    <p>{{ practiceAreas.length }} areas of focused practice in corporate law in India, organised the way problems actually arrive at our desk: rarely as a single, isolated question. Each is led by counsel with direct transactional or courtroom experience.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal" style="justify-content:flex-start">Tap or hover any area for detail</p>
    <h2 class="sr-only">All 15 practice areas</h2>
    <div class="pa-grid reveal">
      {% for pa in practiceAreas %}
      <div class="pa-card{% if pa.wide %} pa-card-wide{% endif %}" id="{{ pa.id }}" data-bg="{{ pa.image }}">
        <span class="pa-card-img" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pa-card-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="pa-card-body">
          <svg class="pa-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4">{{ pa.iconSvg | safe }}</svg>
          {% if pa.wide %}<div class="pa-card-text">{% endif %}
          <h3>{{ pa.name }}</h3>
          <div class="pa-card-more"><p>{{ pa.shortDesc }}</p></div>
          {% if pa.wide %}</div>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Practice areas in detail</p>
        <h2>What each area actually covers.</h2>
        <p>A closer look at the matters and sub-services within each of the {{ practiceAreas.length }} practice areas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rows reveal-stagger">
      {% for pa in practiceAreas %}
      <div class="row-item" style="grid-template-columns:260px 1fr{% if loop.last %};border-bottom:1px solid var(--border){% endif %}">
        <h3 style="font-size:18px">{{ pa.name }}</h3>
        <div>
          <p>{{ pa.detail }}</p>
          {% if pa.relatedInsight %}
          {% for article in collections.legalInsights %}{% if article.fileSlug == pa.relatedInsight %}
          <a href="{{ article.url }}" style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-strong);display:inline-block;margin-top:10px">Related reading: {{ article.data.title }} &rarr;</a>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Who we advise</p>
        <h2>Sectors we understand.</h2>
        <p>Practice areas describe what we do. The sectors below describe the businesses and industries we understand — often as important to a good outcome as the law itself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sector-grid reveal-stagger">
      {% for s in sectors %}
      <article class="sector-card" id="{{ s.id }}">
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.desc }}</p>
        {% for pa in practiceAreas %}{% if pa.id == s.related %}
        <a class="sector-card-link" href="#{{ pa.id }}">Related practice: {{ pa.name }}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
        {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Not sure where your matter fits?</p>
        <h2>Most engagements touch more than one area.</h2>
        <p>Tell us what's in front of you. We'll route it to the right counsel within the chambers.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary sec-link">Describe Your Matter</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
